  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Brian Brotsos holds the position of Acting Chief Data and SI Officer (CDSIO) at the U.S. Department of Transportation (DOT). He is responsible for overseeing DOT’s data strategy and the integration of Super Intelligence (SI). His duties ensure the Department effectively uses SI products and possesses the necessary data frameworks and capabilities to support these tools.",
